{"t":"Sarcophagus (Quest)","s":"sarcophagus-quest-11341","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Sarcophagus_Quest_b09694.gif","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Sarcophagus (Quest)</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Sarcophagus (Quest)\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sarcophagus_Quest_b09694.gif\" width=\"64\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Containers\">Containers</a><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Coffins\">Coffins</a><br/>Quest Objects</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"immobile\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Movable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.4<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 14, 2004<br/>Christmas Update 2004</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20150706075803&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sarcophagus_Quest_b09694.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a sarcophagus.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>In the rooms the <a href=\"#/wiki/Pharaohs\">Pharaohs</a> store their <a href=\"#/wiki/Helmet%20of%20the%20Ancients\">helmet pieces</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Vampire%20Crypts\">Vampire Crypts</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>A sarcophagus's purpose is to contain a dead body, like a <a href=\"#/wiki/Coffins\">coffin</a>. Perhaps you can find something useful in it.<br/>Unlike the <a href=\"#/wiki/Sarcophagus\">Sarcophagus</a>, this sarcophagus does not open upon using it and does not have a volume.<br/>Such sarcophagi are part of <a href=\"#/quest/the-ancient-tombs-quest\">The Ancient Tombs Quest</a>, the <a href=\"#/quest/shadows-of-yalahar-quest\">Shadows of Yalahar Quest</a>, and the <a href=\"#/quest/krailos-quest\">Krailos Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/asura-palace-quest\">Asura Palace Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Coffins\">Coffins</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Containers\">Containers</a></li><li>Duplicate Sprites</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Helmet%20of%20the%20Ancients\">Helmet of the Ancients</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/krailos-quest\">Krailos Quest</a></li><li>Mahatheb the Vizier (Book)</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sarcophagus\">Sarcophagus</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["asura-palace-quest","krailos-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"asura-palace-quest","quest":"Asura Palace Quest","step":"2-2","n":10,"title":"Sarcófago dos rubis (leste)","kind":"mention","coords":[]},{"slug":"krailos-quest","quest":"Krailos Quest","step":"0-5","n":6,"title":"Apanhar o Ancient Map","kind":"mention","coords":[]}]}}